---
// Servicios de la cabaña. SVGs inline simples (sin librerías).
---
<section id="servicios" class="bg-secondary py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold text-primary sm:text-4xl">Servicios</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-center text-text/70">
      Todo lo que necesitás para tu estadía en Villa Ángela.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Pileta -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 16c1.5 0 1.5 1.5 3 1.5S6.5 16 8 16s1.5 1.5 3 1.5 1.5-1.5 3-1.5 1.5 1.5 3 1.5 1.5-1.5 3-1.5" />
          <path d="M2 20c1.5 0 1.5 1.5 3 1.5S6.5 20 8 20s1.5 1.5 3 1.5 1.5-1.5 3-1.5 1.5 1.5 3 1.5 1.5-1.5 3-1.5" />
          <path d="M8 16V5a2 2 0 0 1 4 0M16 16V5a2 2 0 0 1 4 0" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Pileta</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Para refrescarte en los días de calor chaqueño.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Parrilla cubierta -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3 6h18l-2 6H5L3 6z" />
          <path d="M7 12l-1 6M17 12l1 6M9 15h6" />
          <path d="M8 6V4M12 6V3M16 6V4" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Parrilla cubierta</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Un buen asado, llueva o haga sol.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- WiFi -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12.5a10 10 0 0 1 14 0" />
          <path d="M8 15.5a6 6 0 0 1 8 0" />
          <path d="M11 18.5a2 2 0 0 1 2 0" />
          <circle cx="12" cy="20" r="0.6" fill="currentColor" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">WiFi</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Conexión en todas las cabañas.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Desayuno opcional -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 11h13v4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H8a4 4 0 0 1-4-4v-4z" />
          <path d="M17 12h2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-2" />
          <path d="M8 7c0-1 .8-1.5.8-2.5M12 7c0-1 .8-1.5.8-2.5" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Desayuno opcional</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Sumá el desayuno casero a tu reserva.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Estacionamiento -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3 13l2-5a2 2 0 0 1 1.9-1.3h10.2A2 2 0 0 1 19 8l2 5" />
          <path d="M3 13h18v4a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-1H6v1a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-4z" />
          <path d="M6.5 15.5h.01M17.5 15.5h.01" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Estacionamiento</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Espacio propio dentro del predio.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Mascotas permitidas -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="6.5" cy="10" r="1.6" />
          <circle cx="10.5" cy="7" r="1.6" />
          <circle cx="14.5" cy="7" r="1.6" />
          <circle cx="18" cy="10" r="1.6" />
          <path d="M8 14.5c1.2-1.6 2.4-2.5 4-2.5s2.8.9 4 2.5c1 1.4.4 3.5-1.6 3.5-1 0-1.6-.6-2.4-.6s-1.4.6-2.4.6c-2 0-2.6-2.1-1.6-3.5z" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Mascotas permitidas</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Tu compañero de cuatro patas es bienvenido.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
